# gRPC Patterns

## Overview
gRPC-specific patterns for service definitions, error handling, streaming, and client management.

## Error Handling

**✅ CORRECT - Use RpcException:**
```typescript
import { RpcException } from '@nestjs/microservices';
import { GrpcStatusCode } from '@microservices-shared/grpc-exceptions';

@MessagePattern('getUser')
async getUser(data: { id: string }) {
  if (!data.id) {
    throw new RpcException({
      code: GrpcStatusCode.INVALID_ARGUMENT,
      message: 'User ID is required',
    });
  }
  // ...
}
```

**❌ WRONG - Never use HTTP exceptions:**
```typescript
// ❌ WRONG
throw new BadRequestException('Invalid'); // Use RpcException
```

## Proto File Organization

**✅ CORRECT - Organize by service:**
```
user-service/
  proto/
    user.proto
    user_service.proto
```

